Wine ncrypt: create and import ECDSA P-256, P-384 and P-521 keys next to the ECDH ones, with "ECDSA" as their algorithm group, so ECDsaCng in .NET Framework 4.8 can import a public key and verify a signature. LuminaXP for X-Plane 12 checks its release signature this way; ncrypt rejected the ECS1 blob as an unhandled key magic.
Applies to wine-cachyos after ncrypt-ecdh-secret-agreement.patch with: patch -p1 --forward --fuzz=0 -i <this file>

